The radical profile has full-mask mass phi(210)=48; P_14 thickens it to 576.
The multiplier is ((2^2-1)/(2-1))*((3^2-1)/(3-1)) = 3*4 = 12, coming from the repeated 6 blocks.
By contrast phi(P_14)=288=6*phi(210); totient itself sees only the p-fold exponent thickening, while the full squarefree copy atom sees all nonzero p-power divisor layers.

